      "title": "Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set with Suction – 10 Pcs Baby-Led Weaning Supplies: Suction Bowl, Divided Plate, Adjustable Soft Bib, Spoon, Fork, Snack Cup & Utensils, Sakura Pink | Essential Mealtime Kit for Toddlers",
      "body_html": "<p><br></p>\n<p>Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set with Suction – 10 Pcs Baby-Led Weaning Supplies: Suction Bowl, Divided Plate, Adjustable Soft Bib, Spoon, Fork, Snack Cup &amp; Utensils, Sakura Pink | Essential Mealtime Kit for Toddlers. </p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set with Suction – 10 Pcs Baby-Led Weaning Supplies: Suction Bowl, Divided Plate, Adjustable Soft Bib, Spoon, Fork, Snack Cup &amp; Utensils, Sakura Pink | Essential Mealtime Kit for Toddlers\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/01752dd1-7094-4d1a-9db8-59f09cc2e8b3.jpg?v=1757349004\"></div>\n<p>The Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set combines safe, mess-free functionality with a stylish Sakura Pink finish to create the perfect baby-led weaning solution for modern families. This thoughtfully designed 10-piece set equips parents with everything needed to encourage independence, reduce spills, and make mealtimes more enjoyable for both babies and toddlers.</p>\n<h3>Smart Design Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete 10-Piece Bundle – Includes suction bowl, divided plate, adjustable bib, spoon, fork, snack cup with lid, and other essential utensils.</li>\n<li>Strong Suction Base – Keeps bowls and plates firmly in place, preventing tipping and messy spills.</li>\n<li>Premium Food-Grade Silicone – 100% BPA-free, phthalate-free, and safe for delicate gums and developing teeth.</li>\n<li>Adjustable Soft Bib – Comfortable fit with a deep catch pocket for food and liquid spills.</li>\n<li>Baby-Friendly Utensils – Ergonomically designed spoon and fork support self-feeding and motor skill development.</li>\n<li>Snack Cup with Lid – Ideal for storing snacks at home or on-the-go, spill-resistant for travel convenience.</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set with Suction – 10 Pcs Baby-Led Weaning Supplies: Suction Bowl, Divided Plate, Adjustable Soft Bib, Spoon, Fork, Snack Cup &amp; Utensils, Sakura Pink | Essential Mealtime Kit for Toddlers\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/f21d7f5f-a3ce-4260-aafa-43867cca84d8.jpg?v=1757349007\"></div>\n<h3>Setup and Usage</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Press suction bowl or plate onto a smooth, clean surface for a secure hold.</li>\n<li>Adjust the soft silicone bib to fit comfortably around your baby’s neck.</li>\n<li>Encourage self-feeding with the included spoon and fork, or assist as needed.</li>\n<li>Store finger foods or snacks in the spill-proof snack cup with lid.</li>\n<li>After meals, wash items with warm soapy water or place in the dishwasher for easy cleaning.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: 100% food-grade silicone, BPA-free, non-toxic</li>\n<li>Set Includes: Suction bowl, divided plate, adjustable bib, spoon, fork, snack cup with lid, and utensils (10 pieces total)</li>\n<li>Color: Sakura Pink (stylish and gender-neutral)</li>\n<li>Style: Baby-led weaning and toddler mealtime essentials</li>\n<li>Care: Dishwasher and microwave safe for daily convenience</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set with Suction – 10 Pcs Baby-Led Weaning Supplies: Suction Bowl, Divided Plate, Adjustable Soft Bib, Spoon, Fork, Snack Cup &amp; Utensils, Sakura Pink | Essential Mealtime Kit for Toddlers\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/38ec8589-ad19-4a59-a8a6-8ba1a4d73463.jpg?v=1757349008\"></div>\n<h3>Why Choose This Feeding Set</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Mess-Free Mealtimes – Strong suction reduces food spills and keeps dishes in place.</li>\n<li>Safe &amp; Durable – Non-toxic silicone ensures long-lasting, worry-free use.</li>\n<li>Supports Baby-Led Weaning – Designed for independence, motor skill growth, and healthy eating habits.</li>\n<li>Easy to Clean – Dishwasher-safe, stain-resistant, and quick-drying.</li>\n<li>Beautiful Sakura Pink Finish – Adds a touch of charm to your baby’s mealtime setup.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>✅ With the Saquela Silicone Baby Feeding Set, you can transform mealtimes into stress-free, fun learning experiences while giving your baby the tools to grow confidently into self-feeding.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">A Nestacular Promise</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>At <span style=\"color: black;\">Nestacular</span>, we believe in the quality of our products, so we offer a <span style=\"color: black;\">30-day Money-Back</span> <span style=\"color: black;\">Guarantee,</span> <span style=\"color: #404040;\">no questions asked! When you purchase from us, there is</span> <span style=\"color: black;\">ZERO Risk</span> <span style=\"color: #404040;\">for you!</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Congratulations!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>You’ve found a hidden discount code! Use code “TTD” at checkout to claim an additional 10% OFF your ENTIRE order!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Customer Support:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Email: support@nestacular.com</strong></p>",
