      "id": 9866676470102,
      "title": "Tarrokko Babycare 3-in-1 Feeding Bowl - Suction Snack, Soup & Straw Dish with Handle",
      "body_html": "<p>Tarrokko Babycare 3-in-1 Feeding Bowl combines smart multifunctional design with baby-safe materials to create the perfect mealtime solution for infants and toddlers. This thoughtfully designed bowl adapts to different foods and feeding stages, making it a must-have for growing families.</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1612779407243.jpg?v=1759676565\" alt=\"Tarrokko Babycare 3-in-1 Feeding Bowl - Suction Snack, Soup &amp; Straw Dish with Handle\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<p>Smart Design Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>3-in-1 design works as a suction snack bowl, soup bowl, and straw dish</li>\n<li>Strong suction base prevents spills and keeps mealtime mess-free</li>\n<li>Ergonomic handle makes it easy for little hands to hold and learn self-feeding</li>\n<li>Built-in straw encourages independent drinking while reducing waste</li>\n<li>Petal-style snack lid helps toddlers enjoy finger foods without spills</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Durable, easy-to-clean materials ensure long-lasting use<br><br> <br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1612779415691.jpg?v=1759676572\" alt=\"Tarrokko Babycare 3-in-1 Feeding Bowl - Suction Snack, Soup &amp; Straw Dish with Handle\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<p>Setup and Usage <br>Secure the suction base to a smooth, clean surface. Use with the included straw for liquids or soups, the petal lid for snacks, or as a standard bowl for purees and meals. Wash thoroughly after each use to maintain hygiene.</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1612779407239.jpg?v=1759676570\" alt=\"Tarrokko Babycare 3-in-1 Feeding Bowl - Suction Snack, Soup &amp; Straw Dish with Handle\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<p>Product Specifications</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: Safe, BPA-free, food-grade plastic and silicone</li>\n<li>Dimensions: Standard toddler-friendly size with suction base</li>\n<li>Style: 3-in-1 multifunctional bowl with handle, straw, and petal lid</li>\n<li>Suitable for: Snacks, soups, purees, and toddler meals</li>\n<li>Package: 1 complete 3-in-1 feeding bowl set</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Why Choose This Bowl</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li> Reduces mealtime mess with a secure suction design</li>\n<li>Versatile 3-in-1 function grows with your child’s needs</li>\n<li>Encourages independent eating and drinking</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and safe for daily use</li>\n<li>Durable, travel-friendly design for at home or on the go</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>A Nestacular Promise</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>At Nestacular, we believe in the quality of our products, so we offer a 30-day Money-Back Guarantee, no questions asked! When you purchase from us, there is ZERO Risk for you!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Congratulations!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>You’ve found a hidden discount code! Use code “TTD” at checkout to claim an additional 10% OFF your ENTIRE order!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Customer Support:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email: support@nestacular.com</strong></span></p>",
